{
  "_doc": "Cadastre conventions per ISO country code, applied only while that country is an active market. id_pattern is the parcel (cadastral) number format checked by PAR-006; area_tolerance is the allowed difference between the computed and the registered area for PAR-001 (formula k_mt_sqrt_area: k * Mt * sqrt(P), P in m2, result in m2); marks lists the boundary mark types the surveyor picks from, with whether each one is a physical monument. A country without an entry, or a field left out, keeps the neutral default: any parcel id, the project's percentage tolerance and the neutral mark list. status to_verify means the pack author has not yet checked the entry against the source.",
